        "answer": {
          "short": "$B(-9,-2)$",
          "worked": "Let $B=(x,y)$. Using the midpoint formula,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x+5}{2}&=-2 & \\frac{y+(-6)}{2}&=-4\\\\ x+5&=-4 & y-6&=-8\\\\ x&=-9 & y&=-2.\\end{align*}$$\nThus $B=(-9,-2)$.",
